"dismissal":false,"batsman":{"athlete":{"id":"784373","name":"Kamindu Mendis","shortName":"Kamindu Mendis"}},"text":""},"bbbTimestamp":1792327057000,"sortOrder":2000.02},"210":{"id":"210","team":{"id":"8","name":"Sri Lanka","abbreviation":"SL"},"mediaId":0,"period":2,"preText":"It is going to be an uphill battle for Sri Lanka to chase this target down. The Pakistan players and the umpires are in the middle. The Sri Lankan openers - Avishka Fernando and Kamindu Mendis - are now making their way to the middle. The Pakistan captain will open the bowling for his side and he has deployed two slips for Mendis. Here we go!","text":"Swing early on! Full and wide of off. It is punched to Fakhar at point and he makes a mess of it.","postText":"","shortText":"Shaheen Shah Afridi to PHKD Mendis, 2 runs","homeScore":"0","awayScore":"2/0","scoreValue":2,"sequence":200001,"boundary":false,"bowler":{"athlete":{"id":"1072470","name":"Shaheen Shah Afridi","firstName":"Shaheen","lastName":"Afridi","fullName":"Shaheen Shah Afridi","displayName":"Shaheen Shah Afridi"},"team":{"id":"7","name":"Pakistan","abbreviation":"PAK"},"maidens":0,"balls":1,"wickets":0,"overs":0.1,"conceded":2},"otherBowler":{"athlete":{},"team":{"id":"7","name":"Pakistan","abbreviation":"PAK"},"maidens":0,"balls":0,"wickets":0,"overs":0,"conceded":0},"batsman":{"athlete":{"id":"784373","name":"Kamindu Mendis","firstName":"Kamindu","lastName":"Mendis","fullName":"Pasqual Handi Kamindu Dilanka Mendis","displayName":"Kamindu Mendis"},"team":{"id":"8","name":"Sri Lanka","abbreviation":"SL"},"totalRuns":2,"faced":1,"fours":0,"runs":2,"sixes":0},"otherBatsman":{"athlete":{"id":"784369","name":"Avishka Fernando","firstName":"Avishka","lastName":"Fernando","fullName":"Weerahandige Inol Avishka Fernando","displayName":"Avishka Fernando"},"team":{"id":"8","name":"Sri Lanka","abbreviation":"SL"},"totalRuns":0,"faced":0,"fours":0,"runs":0,"sixes":0},"innings":{"id":"296770","runRate":12,"remainingBalls":299,"byes":0,"number":2,"balls":1,"noBalls":0,"requiredRunRate":6.1,"wickets":0,"legByes":0,"ballLimit":300,"target":306,"session":1,"day":1,"fallOfWickets":0,"trailBy":0,"leadBy":0,"remainingRuns":304,"remainingOvers":49.5,"totalRuns":2,"wides":0,"runs":2},"over":{"ball":1,"balls":6,"complete":false,"limit":50.0,"maiden":0,"noBall":0,"wide":0,"legByes":0,"byes":0,"number":1,"runs":4,"wickets":0,"overs":0.1,"actual":0.1,"unique":0.01},"dismissal":{"dismissal":false,"batsman":{"athlete":{"id":"784373","name":"Kamindu Mendis","shortName":"Kamindu Mendis"}},"text":""},"bbbTimestamp":1792327042000,"sortOrder":2000.01},"149050":{"id":"149050","team":{"id":"7","name":"Pakistan","abbreviation":"PAK"},"mediaId":0,"period":1,"preText":"","text":"low full toss, this time connects as long-on collects. Shaheen wants to go back and get on strike, but the throw is a good one, as Malinga collects and runs out Rauf, who is well short. <B>Pakistan are bowled out for 305</b>","postText":"<b>Today's <a href=\"https://www.cricinfo.com/game/wordplay\">WORD PLAY</a> meanwhile has six letters. Can you crack it?</b>\n\nAhsan should be back for the chase in about 30 minutes but while you wait, <b>see if you can make the connections in our fiendish game! Mullally, Ntini, Sangakkara, Maharaj? Do they <a href=\"https://www.cricinfo.com/game/match-up\">MATCH UP</a>?</b>\n\nTharindu : \"Sri Lanka vs Pakistan matches are the easiest to watch. Such friendship and brotherhood between the two teams and even the fans don't mind losing to the other. \"\n\n<B>5.05pm</b> So just 26 runs given away in the final five overs, with Sri Lanka picking up five wickets in that same period. It gives the visitors the momentum as they head into the break, despite Pakistan breaching the 300-mark. It was a period that helped mitigate a magnificent innings 107 off 90 from Salman Ali Agha, during which he put on stands of 97 and 64 with Hasan Nawaz and Arafat Minhas. But once Agha fell close to the death, the wheels came off for Pakistan as Eshan Malinga in particular showcased his death bowling prowess to end with figures of 4 for 46. Agha's knock though was pivotal in helping revive a flagging Pakistan innings after they lost Babar Azam and debutant Saad Baig in quick succession, after the pair had stitched together a promising third wicket stand of 74. But on a good batting track, Sri Lanka's bowlers did well to not let Pakistan's batters run free, even if they were punished at times for the lack of a genuine fifth bowling option.","shortText":"Malinga to Shaheen Shah Afridi, 1 run, OUT","homeScore":"305/10","awayScore":"0","scoreValue":1,"sequence":104905,"boundary":false,"bowler":{"athlete":{"id":"1306214","name":"Eshan Malinga","firstName":"Eshan","lastName":"Malinga","fullName":"Kiribathgala Kankanamalage Eshan Malinga Dharmasena","displayName":"Eshan Malinga"},"team":{"id":"8","name":"Sri Lanka","abbreviation":"SL"},"maidens":1,"balls":59,"wickets":4,"overs":9.5,"conceded":46},"otherBowler":{"athlete":{"id":"793007","name":"Dilshan Madushanka","firstName":"Dilshan","lastName":"Madushanka","fullName":"Lokumarakkalage Dilshan Madushanka","displayName":"Dilshan Madushanka"},"team":{"id":"8","name":"Sri Lanka","abbreviation":"SL"},"maidens":0,"balls":60,"wickets":2,"overs":10.0,"conceded":67},"batsman":{"athlete":{"id":"1072470","name":"Shaheen Shah Afridi","firstName":"Shaheen","lastName":"Afridi","fullName":"Shaheen Shah Afridi","displayName":"Shaheen Shah Afridi"},"team":{"id":"7","name":"Pakistan","abbreviation":"PAK"},"totalRuns":13,"faced":12,"fours":2,"runs":1,"sixes":0},"otherBatsman":{"athlete":{"id":"1161606","name":"Haris Rauf","firstName":"Haris","lastName":"Rauf","fullName":"Haris Rauf","displayName":"Haris Rauf"},"team":{"id":"7","name":"Pakistan","abbreviation":"PAK"},"totalRuns":0,"faced":4,"fours":0,"runs":0,"sixes":0},"innings":{"id":"296769","runRate":6.12,"remainingBalls":1,"byes":0,"number":1,"balls":299,"noBalls":0,"wickets":10,"legByes":0,"ballLimit":300,"target":0,"session"